**Refining SVG Rendering**

I'm now focusing on optimizing the SVG rendering for the ornaments. I've realized raw SVGs often lack width/height attributes and require specific CSS. The missing CSS is:
```css
.top-header-grid svg, .top-header-grid img {
    max-height: 18px !important;
    width: auto !important;
    max-width: 90% !important;
    object-fit: contain !important;
    display: inline-block !important;
    vertical-align: middle !important;
}
```
This, combined with wrapper sizing, guarantees ornaments fit within the header line.

